<title>BRAZIL: FORECAST-Brazilian year-end economic consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Brazilian year-end economic consensus.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are individual and consensus 1997 year-end economic forecasts collected by Reuters from the offices of eight brokerages and research firms in Sao Paulo and Rio de Janeiro.</p>
<p>The year-end survey and consensus results will be updated monthly after the release of the trade balance each month.</p>
